# VTVS design

Follow [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md). Space is used by the split, not by empty mastheads.

**Type:** Satoshi 1.125rem / 500 for nav, lead, phones. Newsreader optical ~72, roman, for H1. Never italicize the H1. Never Inter, Roboto, Cormorant, Manrope. Do not antialias body text — it reads gray on paper.

**Color:** `--paper #EFEBE3`, `--ink #1C1915` for all reading text, `--mark #6E1F1C` for the square hero Kontakt button, nav hover rectangles, and hover on phones. Do not fade body, lead, phones, or nav. No 0.75rem tracked captions.

**Hero ≥960px:** `2fr / 3fr` (40% copy / 60% photo), full viewport height. Photo bleeds to the top under the fixed nav. Copy top-aligned with φ spacing plus `--header-h`. Not 50/50. Not vertically centered. No slogan on the hero. `#sluzby` sits under the hero as a two-column letter list, then `#kontakt` as a 2fr/3fr split with phones left and address/IČ right (no letter form). Inner page `/o-nas` uses the same split, shorter; Podporujeme is a catalog band, Odkazy is a conventional directory list. `/cenik` is a compact letter tariff, not a catalog grid. The same contact footer closes inner pages.

**Actions:** one square wine **Kontakt** button on the hero. Phones stay in `#kontakt`.

```css
/* ❌ */
.hero-lead { color: #5e5952; }
.trust-bar { font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.7; }
.hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
.hero-copy { justify-content: center; }

/* ✅ */
.hero-lead, .ink-link, .slogan { color: var(--ink); }
.hero { grid-template-columns: minmax(20rem, 2fr) 3fr; }
.hero-copy { justify-content: flex-start; }
```

No eyebrows, meta lines, decorative rules, photo gradients, box-shadows, pill buttons, or entrance fades. Header uses progressive blur, not a solid paper bar.
